          "graphId": "topic-template"
        },
        "overview": "A single graph model can represent many application ecosystems through composable templates. Import fidelity, live integration, and execution are separate milestones.",
        "keyQuestions": "Which five reusable families unlock the most integrations? Which converters can preserve source semantics? What requires a provider or runtime?",
        "documentation": "Investigated 2026-09-23, via direct codebase research (Explore agent), grounded in file:line citations, not inference from documentation alone."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "graph-application-template-catalog-synthesis",
