      "data": {
        "title": "Build reusable templates before application clones",
        "summary": "Prove one faithful n8n workflow import and one schema-derived Salesforce graph. Prioritize Entity, Workflow, Function, Resource, Schema. Templates represent; converters translate; providers fetch or execute.",
        "openQuestions": "Which imports round-trip losslessly? How should nested subflows map to multi-graph workspaces? What capabilities require desktop/server execution?",
